	(text "POWER: battery pads, current shunt (low side), 10V gate-driver rail (LMR16006Y, 2.1 MHz), 3.3V LDO for the 4 MCUs.\nAdd a 470-1000uF 35V low-ESR electrolytic on the battery leads (not on the PCB).\nLMR16006: Vout = 0.765V x (1 + 121k/10k) = 10.0V.  Shunt: BAT- pad -> 4x 1mOhm -> board GND."
